# Project Enhancements: Hero Section

I have added dynamic and interactive elements to the Hero section to enhance the user experience and visual appeal.

## New Features

1.  **Dynamic Text Phrases**: The sub-heading now cycles through multiple security and developer-focused phrases with a smooth fade animation.
2.  **Scroll-Reactive Background**: The background orbs now respond to page scrolling with a parallax effect, moving at different speeds to create a sense of depth.

